{
"file": 1168,
"paths": [
"d009/d044/f055"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "c43b52f7",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Master Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "4131df78",
"en_raw": "...what"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "b75db8b7",
"en_raw": "Um... what's wrong?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "fca5b6ac",
"en_raw": "I always thought you were"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "15a1fb65",
"en_raw": "hopeless"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "d1ed16e2",
"en_raw": "but you really are"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "fd1bbf63",
"en_raw": "beyond saving even if you die"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "00741593",
"en_raw": "Swept up in trends"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "b7314d81",
"en_raw": "making up stupid fantasies"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f1202d16",
"en_raw": "and yet looking down"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "a9aa0cd2",
"en_raw": "and laughing at others..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "b9e7a483",
"en_raw": "Just who"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "4a56a2bb",
"en_raw": "do you think you are?"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "5ad895ed",
"en_raw": "...Wait a moment, please"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "a6885e6b",
"en_raw": "Why do I have to take that much"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "ad828e7b",
"en_raw": "You just said it to Shiina"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "193cd5d0",
"en_raw": "yourself, didn't you!"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "11fb8a33",
"en_raw": "...That's, that"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "ea0e0477",
"en_raw": "You know"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "b962a458",
"en_raw": "Did you hear?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "9f432f75",
"en_raw": "The story about Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "93bc17f0",
"en_raw": "I've put up"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "e1ec708d",
"en_raw": "with how stupid and annoying you are"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5083d0ea",
"en_raw": "Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "74b7aa70",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but this is how I really feel"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "2b9addbc",
"en_raw": "...A farewell gift"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "cc1d3bde",
"en_raw": "That girl really"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "a279dfa6",
"en_raw": "isn't normal, is she"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "3f469443",
"en_raw": "Well, I thought she'd"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f909499a",
"en_raw": "do something someday"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d4c35229",
"en_raw": "Do you believe that"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2a703e69",
"en_raw": "But it's good, right"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "830ed943",
"en_raw": "Now Master Hirauchi too"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "2a50e626",
"en_raw": "won't be pestered anymore"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "0a0aa22d",
"en_raw": "A problem child like that"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "bd7761b8",
"en_raw": "the PTA wouldn't leave alone..."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "caafa0d3",
"en_raw": "I'm asking if you"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "4f03e7a5",
"en_raw": "believe that!"
}
]
}